{
  "title": "Jubilant Indian Vegetable Fritters",
  "description": "A festive Bengali dish featuring bitter and molten vegetable fritters, made with a variety of vegetables and spices, served with a side of vegetable stock.",
  "cuisine": "Indian",
  "diet": [
    "gluten-free",
    "vegetarian"
